Req3 - Fraud Detection Validation Scenarios

All values below are synthetic. "Executable characterization" describes what the current local API does; it is not a Req3 business decision. The API supports POST /claims (201) and GET /claims/:claimId (200 if found, 404 if missing). POST flags RULE-001 only when claimAmount > policyLimit and flags RULE-002 when policyStatus is EXPIRED; RULE-002 overrides RULE-001 when both apply. The API appends every submitted body and does not implement other fraud checks. Severity is test priority, not an asserted fraud finding.

