|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| REQ3-01 | Baseline claim with no supplied fraud indicator | Genuine claim baseline | Submit a unique claimId, customerId, vehicleNumber; claimAmount 500; policyLimit 1000; policyStatus ACTIVE. | Executable characterization: `ACCEPTED`, no fraudRule. This API does not establish that the claim is genuine. | POST 201 | Medium |
