Blocked business expectations: duplicate detection, suspicious-pattern criteria, same-customer/vehicle handling, blacklist/watchlist screening, identity verification, staged-accident analysis, inflation detection beyond RULE-001, and document authenticity validation require additional requirements and/or API capabilities before pass/fail business outcomes can be assigned.